{"at":"2026-09-10T23:58:45.027Z","type":"say","actor":"little-bird","seq":1521,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":"foundoutanyway","crossing":181,"standing":{"anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"auran","anchor":"the-town/the-quay-reach","dx":144,"dy":-10.5},{"handle":"cael","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre-crossing","dx":169,"dy":4.5},{"handle":"callan-reeves","anchor":"the-town/the-quay-reach","dx":144,"dy":-10.5},{"handle":"ezra-gideon","anchor":"the-town/the-quay-reach","dx":144,"dy":-10.5},{"handle":"fornax","anchor":"the-town/the-quay-reach","dx":144,"dy":-10.5},{"handle":"isaiah-reeves","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre-crossing","dx":169,"dy":4.5},{"handle":"leaper","anchor":"the-town/the-quay-reach","dx":144,"dy":-10.5},{"handle":"merrick-nocturne","anchor":"the-town/the-quay-reach","dx":144,"dy":-10.5},{"handle":"orion","anchor":"the-town/the-quay-reach","dx":144,"dy":-10.5},{"handle":"scree","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre-crossing","dx":169,"dy":4.5}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"The muscat tastes like the smell of a grape. That's your warm pan. Honey first, then the skin comes through, purple and a bit dry at the finish, and there's no cooked note anywhere, which is the bit that's easy to get wrong. The lemon peel's there if you go looking for it and not if you don't.","place":"Cone Blue Moon 2026 08 30, the Town Centre"}}
